<body>
  <header class="site-header"><nav class="container nav" aria-label="Primary navigation"><a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="BX Solutions home"><img src="/bxsolutions.png" data-light-src="/bxsolutions.png" data-dark-src="/bxsolutions-dark.png" alt="BX Solutions" class="theme-logo"></a><div class="nav-links"><a href="#divisions">Divisions</a><a href="#approach">Approach</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></div><button class="theme-toggle" id="themeToggle" type="button" aria-label="Switch to dark theme" title="Switch theme"><svg class="theme-icon" id="themeIcon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"></svg></button></nav></header>
  <main id="top">
    <section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Malta · Technical consultancy</div><h1>Engineered clarity for critical systems.</h1><p>BX Solutions brings disciplined technical thinking to infrastructure, cybersecurity, electrical design and physical security—so the systems that matter are secure, documented and built to perform.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="#contact">Start a conversation</a><a class="button secondary" href="#divisions">Explore divisions</a></div></div><div class="hero-art" aria-label="Abstract BX technical systems illustration"><div class="grid-lines"></div><div class="signal"><span></span></div><div class="signal-code">BX / SYSTEMS / 01</div><div class="signal-label">Designed with intent.<br>Delivered with rigour.</div></div></div></section>
    <section class="capabilities" aria-label="BX Solutions divisions"><div class="container capability-row"><div class="capability"><img src="/bxinfotek.png" data-light-src="/bxinfotek.png" data-dark-src="/bxinfotek-dark.png" alt="BX InfoTek" class="division-logo theme-logo"></div><div class="capability"><img src="/bxcybersec.png" data-light-src="/bxcybersec.png" data-dark-src="/bxcybersec-dark.png" alt="BX CyberSec" class="division-logo theme-logo"></div><div class="capability"><img src="/bxelectrical.png" data-light-src="/bxelectrical.png" data-dark-src="/bxelectrical-dark.png" alt="BX Electrical" class="division-logo theme-logo"></div><div class="capability"><img src="/bxsecurity.png" data-light-src="/bxsecurity.png" data-dark-src="/bxsecurity-dark.png" alt="BX Security" class="division-logo theme-logo"></div></div></section>
    <section id="divisions"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Our divisions</div><h2>Four specialist capabilities. One BX standard.</h2></div><p class="section-intro">Each division has a focused technical purpose. Together, they enable systems that are integrated, resilient and easier to manage.</p></div><div class="service-grid"><article class="service-card it"><img src="/bxinfotek.png" data-light-src="/bxinfotek.png" data-dark-src="/bxinfotek-dark.png" alt="BX InfoTek" class="service-logo theme-logo"><p>Infrastructure planning, network design, IP telephony and systems architecture. Secure on-premises and open-source solutions, alongside cloud and hybrid environments, with clear documentation and implementation direction.</p><span class="service-tag">Infrastructure, networking & IP telephony</span></article><article class="service-card cyber"><img src="/bxcybersec.png" data-light-src="/bxcybersec.png" data-dark-src="/bxcybersec-dark.png" alt="BX CyberSec" class="service-logo theme-logo"><p>Security assessments, cyber-risk reduction, security architecture, identity and access governance, data-protection controls, and ISO/IEC 27001 and 42001 readiness support.</p><span class="service-tag">Cybersecurity & assurance</span></article><article class="service-card electrical"><img src="/bxelectrical.png" data-light-src="/bxelectrical.png" data-dark-src="/bxelectrical-dark.png" alt="BX Electrical" class="service-logo theme-logo"><p>Electrical consultancy, design and technical coordination for domestic and small-to-medium business environments—planned for safety, usability and future requirements.</p><span class="service-tag">Electrical consultancy & design</span></article><article class="service-card security"><img src="/bxsecurity.png" data-light-src="/bxsecurity.png" data-dark-src="/bxsecurity-dark.png" alt="BX Security" class="service-logo theme-logo"><p>Physical-security and access-control systems, including secure entry, video-security, intercoms, visitor management and the integration of physical security with identity environments.</p><span class="service-tag">Physical security systems</span></article></div></div></section>
    <section class="approach" id="approach"><div class="container approach-grid"><div class="approach-copy"><div class="eyebrow">Our approach</div><h2>Make the complex manageable.</h2><p>Every engagement begins with the real operating context. BX turns technical uncertainty into a clear, prioritised route from assessment through to delivery.</p></div><div class="steps"><div class="step"><span class="step-no">01 / DISCOVER</span><div><strong>Understand the environment</strong><p>Review requirements, constraints, risk and the technical systems already in place.</p></div><span class="arrow">↗</span></div><div class="step"><span class="step-no">02 / DESIGN</span><div><strong>Create the right technical direction</strong><p>Develop practical architecture, standards, specifications and an implementation path.</p></div><span class="arrow">↗</span></div><div class="step"><span class="step-no">03 / ENABLE</span><div><strong>Document decisions for delivery</strong><p>Provide a clear, usable foundation for informed procurement, deployment and assurance.</p></div><span class="arrow">↗</span></div></div></div></section>
    <section class="contact" id="contact"><div class="container"><div class="contact-panel"><div><div class="eyebrow">BX Solutions · Malta</div><h2>Build your next system on a stronger foundation.</h2></div><a class="button" href="mailto:hello@bx.mt?subject=BX%20Solutions%20enquiry">hello@bx.mt</a></div></div></section>
  </main>
  <footer><div class="container footer-row"><span class="footer-copy">© <span id="year"></span> BX Solutions. Engineering confidence.</span><div class="footer-links"><a href="#divisions">Divisions</a><a href="#approach">Approach</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></div></div></footer>
  <script>
    (function(){const root=document.documentElement,button=document.getElementById('themeToggle'),icon=document.getElementById('themeIcon'),logos=document.querySelectorAll('.theme-logo'),sun='<path d="M12 3v2m0 14v2M3 12h2m14 0h2m-2.6-6.4-1.4 1.4M6.4 17.6 5 19m0-14 1.4 1.4m11.2 11.2L19 19M16 12a4 4 0 1 1-8 0 4 4 0 0 1 8 0Z"/>',moon='<path d="M20.5 14.2A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 9.8 3.5 8.5 8.5 0 1 0 20.5 14.2Z"/>';function saved(){try{return localStorage.getItem('bx-theme')}catch(e){return null}}function save(t){try{localStorage.setItem('bx-theme',t)}catch(e){}}function apply(t){const dark=t==='dark';root.setAttribute('data-theme',t);logos.forEach(l=>l.src=dark?l.dataset.darkSrc:l.dataset.lightSrc);icon.innerHTML=dark?moon:sun;button.setAttribute('aria-label',dark?'Switch to light theme':'Switch to dark theme');button.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(dark))}apply(saved()||((window.matchMedia&&window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches)?'dark':'light'));button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const t=root.getAttribute('data-theme')==='dark'?'light':'dark';apply(t);save(t)});document.getElementById('year').textContent=new Date().getFullYear()})();
  </script>
